  "identity": "Barnacled sea-thing that collects overdue books. Huge squat blue-green squid-crab body, broad drooping fish lips, tiny furious gold eyes under barnacled brow, cream shell plates and dangling short beardlike tentacles. Two enormous fin-claws, stubby gripping tentacle feet. Rusted SHIP ANCHOR in its right claw, a soggy book chained to left. A big kelp belt around rounded belly. Comic grumpy deep-sea debt collector.",
